### Describe the bug

Issue https://github.com/swc-project/swc/issues/5214 still exists in 1.3.9

Reproduction repository:
https://github.com/gzzhanghao/swc-paths-extensions

### Input code

```typescript
import { modulo } from '@modules/style.module.less'
import { sum } from './sum.js'
```


### Config

```json
{
  "jsc": {
    "baseUrl": "./src",
    "paths": {
      "@modules/*": ["./modules/*"]
    },
    "target": "es2020",
    "parser": {
      "syntax": "typescript"
    }
  },
  "module": {
    "type": "es6"
  }
}
```


### Playground link

_No response_

### Expected behavior

```ts
import { modulo } from "./modules/style.module.less";
import { sum } from "./sum";
```

### Actual behavior

```ts
import { modulo } from "./modules/style.module";
import { sum } from "./sum.js";
```

### Version

1.3.9

### Additional context

_No response_
